"$$$/MediaCore/AEFilters/AEMetadata/TrackAndMetadataLabelSeparator=  #{comment}The text that separates the track label from the metadata label when Show Source Track Label and Show Metadata Label are both checked. JIRA: DVAPR-4234565"
